# Loaded by `vite build --mode crazygames` (npm run build:crazygames).
#
# Switches the app to hash-based routing (CrazyGames serve the game from an
# unknown subpath inside an iframe, with no server to answer a history-API deep
# link) and turns on the CrazyGames SDK calls in src/ui/crazygames.ts.
#
# Deliberately no VITE_POSTHOG_KEY: that build aliases posthog-js away entirely
# (see vite.config.ts), so there is no analytics to configure. Its siblings
# .env.production and .env.itch both carry the key, so the omission here looks
# like an oversight and is not — adding it would inline a token into a bundle
# whose posthog-js is a no-op shim.
VITE_BUILD_TARGET=crazygames
